 "detailed_description": "<h1>中文汉化包现可从 官方QQ频道中下载</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/8da672efe3084ec742463c1763e3dc37.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=225 /></span></p></p><br><h1>关于游戏</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>在严酷的世界中生存</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一层都会抵达新的深度，带来全新挑战，要求你重新适应。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>肢体与心血管模拟系统</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >受伤在所难免。你需要为自己包扎，应对感染的伤口，控制失血避免失去意识。此外，情绪也会显著影响生存几率，过度悲观会让你的处境更加艰难。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>制作以求生存</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >身为具备理性的生物，制作工具能够帮助你更高效地穿越层层洞穴。万一发生出血，洞穴生物群提供的丰富资源也能够帮助你处理伤口。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>风险自负的探索</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >过往的探险队留下了一些不错的战利品，但即便是有益的物品，也有可能导致你的死亡。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>揭开真相</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >旅途的尽头究竟有什么？如果你成功了，等待你的又将是怎样的命运呢？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/4fcbd793385f447abfaf27a4750ea84c.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/4fcbd793385f447abfaf27a4750ea84c.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/4fcbd793385f447abfaf27a4750ea84c.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>游戏特色</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全面的心血管与肢体损伤模拟系统</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可以在冒险过程中提升角色属性，包括智力、力量和韧性</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >提升生存几率的完善制作系统</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3名玩法各异的独特角色</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >总计11层的异星洞穴探险，每一层都充满独特挑战与危险</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300种可发现物品</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可在主菜单调整战利品掉率和危险程度</p></li></ul>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/75c161aa11d713c9a8da32cca80adf4d.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>在严酷的世界中生存</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一层都会抵达新的深度，带来全新挑战，要求你重新适应。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>肢体与心血管模拟系统</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >受伤在所难免。你需要为自己包扎，应对感染的伤口，控制失血避免失去意识。此外，情绪也会显著影响生存几率，过度悲观会让你的处境更加艰难。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.poster.avif?t=1782201614\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.webm?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4576490/extras/b3884ced84ba6d0a433d7dbdf284ab71.mp4?t=1782201614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>制作以求生存</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >身为具备理性的生物，制作工具能够帮助你更高效地穿越层层洞穴。万一发生出血，洞穴生物群提供的丰富资源也能够帮助你处理伤口。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>风险自负的探索</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >过往的探险队留下了一些不错的战利品，但即便是有益的物品，也有可能导致你的死亡。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_pa